WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.586
Subtract B and Bin from A.

00:00:01.586 --> 00:00:03.437
D = A XOR B XOR Bin.

00:00:03.437 --> 00:00:06.610
Bout = (NOT A AND B) OR (NOT(A XOR B) AND Bin).

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.196
Subtract B and Bin from A.

00:00:09.196 --> 00:00:11.047
D = A XOR B XOR Bin.

00:00:11.047 --> 00:00:14.220
Bout = (NOT A AND B) OR (NOT(A XOR B) AND Bin).

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:20.164
